DECL	{"args":[{"name":"x","sort":{"sort":"track"}}],"body":{"add":[{"mul":[{"args":[{"var":"x"}],"measure":"kin_speed"},{"param":"reaction_time"}]},{"div":[{"mul":[{"args":[{"var":"x"}],"measure":"kin_speed"},{"args":[{"var":"x"}],"measure":"kin_speed"}]},{"mul":[{"lit":{"den":1,"num":2},"unit":"ratio"},{"param":"deceleration"}]}]}]},"contract":"The distance road user x would cover from the observation to a standstill if it kept its present speed for reaction_time and then slowed at the constant deceleration deceleration: its speed (kin.speed, m/s) times reaction_time, plus the square of its speed divided by twice deceleration; in metres, zero for a body at a standstill. Not denoted: the distance x actually covers before a later halt, the deceleration the surface, the grade or the vehicle allows (the caller passes deceleration), whether anything lies within the distance, or whether x is required to stop.","definition":null,"id":"drv.motion.stopping_distance","kind":"quantity","narrowings":[],"params":[{"name":"reaction_time","unit":"second"},{"name":"deceleration","unit":"metre_per_second_sq"}],"residues":[],"supersedes":null}
